R97 commit ed0cf9c1b 修 Python 后端 web_server.py (_PUBLIC_API_PATHS + Desktop-Token alias), 不影响 app.asar bundle.
app.asar MD5 ebcc1983b70b5269fd7ab941497837e0 R87/R98 同 (此为预期).

PM-direct 自验:
- /api/status HTTP 200 + 真实 state data (version=0.1.0, gateway_running=true)
- 后端 R97 修通
- desktop .app SPA bundle 含 'if(!window.wenshuDesktop) throw Error('文枢 Desktop bridge is unavailable')'
- window.wenshuDesktop 由 electron-main.mjs preload 注入 (build 产物, R74 PM-direct 禁入仓)
- 装机 user 装的 R87 build electron-main.mjs 注入旧 SPA bundle

后续 R99 派单: 修 desktop .app electron-main.mjs 注入新 window.wenshuDesktop API (desktop SPA IPC bridge 完整修通).

